# App packages are checked byte for byte (checksums, gen-schemas --check, build keys): keep them LF on every OS, also in a
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true. text=auto, not text: git still detects a binary (an icon) and never rewrites it.
apps/** text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
